@props(title:text,stamp:int,server:bool)
<section class="hero wrap"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT ARCHITECTURE STUDIO · EST. 2018</span><h1>Good spaces.<br><em>Better days.</em></h1><p>Homes and places that feel like they belong.<br>Considered, enduring, and quietly extraordinary.</p><a class="button" href="#work">Explore our work <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a><div class="hero-note"><span class="small-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span>Designed around life.<br>Built for the long run.</span></div></div><figure class="hero-art"><img src="/courtyard.svg" alt="Architectural illustration of a sunlit courtyard home with an olive tree" width="720" height="680"><figcaption><span>01 / COURTYARD HOUSE</span><span>2026 · Residential</span></figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="intro wrap"><span class="eyebrow">LESS, BUT BETTER</span><h2>We believe the best spaces<br>make room for what matters.</h2><p>Natural light. Honest materials. A little breathing room. We work closely with people to create architecture that feels as good as it looks.</p></section>
<section id="work" class="work wrap"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Selected work<span>02</span></h2><a href="/studio">Our approach ↗</a></div><div class="work-grid"><article><a href="/studio#courtyard"><img src="/courtyard.svg" alt="Courtyard House, a quiet home arranged around a planted courtyard" width="720" height="680" loading="lazy"><div class="project-title"><h3>Courtyard House</h3><span>Residential · 2026 ↗</span></div></a></article><article><a href="/studio#hillside"><img src="/hillside.svg" alt="Hillside Retreat, a timber home nestled in a green landscape" width="720" height="680" loading="lazy"><div class="project-title"><h3>Hillside Retreat</h3><span>Residential · 2025 ↗</span></div></a></article></div></section>
<section class="invitation wrap"><p>Have something in mind?</p><h2>Let's make<br><em>room for it.</em></h2><a class="button light" href="/studio#contact">Meet your architects ↗</a></section>
